{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/971010de3c75a804c47fa1132c966907.avif?t=1774642576\" width=849 height=168 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add Prison Fury to your Wishlist for launch updates and priority playtest invites. Join our Discord for giveaways.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prison Fury</strong> is a wild, social-first <strong>online 2-player</strong> co-op puzzle game. Team up with a friend and tackle huge chain-style puzzles that force you to plan, communicate, and react. Runs are intense and can take <strong>16\u201345 minutes</strong> \u2014 every choice matters and every run can explode into a chaos clip you\u2019ll want to share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/1d93fcbda3adbdb3e4d5cd20c6c3dede.avif?t=1774642576\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why you\u2019ll love it</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast to jump in, deep to master \u2014 one wrong move and everything can fall apart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for streaming and laughs \u2014 clutch saves, fails, and insane comebacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure teamwork \u2014 your actions literally change your partner\u2019s world</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What the demo includes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 playable demo level (mirrored prison)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online 2-player co-op (invite friends)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A taste of the chained puzzle design and teamwork needed for full runs</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Signature Puzzle Types</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison Fury\u2019s core loop revolves around chained puzzles where each player\u2019s actions enable the other. Representative puzzle types include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Door Puzzle (Color Sequence)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/ff0b8b9fb6538337b96cb64a3782a4c4.poster.avif?t=1774642576\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/ff0b8b9fb6538337b96cb64a3782a4c4.webm?t=1774642576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/ff0b8b9fb6538337b96cb64a3782a4c4.mp4?t=1774642576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platform Chain Puzzle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/2f5ac53eaf53e0dc6970cec45b5af55e.poster.avif?t=1774642576\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/2f5ac53eaf53e0dc6970cec45b5af55e.webm?t=1774642576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/2f5ac53eaf53e0dc6970cec45b5af55e.mp4?t=1774642576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle (Deposit &amp; Stop)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/a752a88949e62